  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed extension by reason of its depth, bulk and scale would cause significant overbearing impacts on the ground floor rear adjacent sitting area and rear window opening of No.35 closest to the shared boundary with the application site. This would cause noticeable loss of daylight/sunlight leading to overshadowing and, creating enclosing, intrusive and obtrusive impacts on the habitable room served by the affected opening, as well as in the rear garden sitting area. Therefore, the resulting impact would be an unneighbourly form of overdevelopment. As such, the proposed scheme is contrary to DMD 11 of the Development Management Document (2014) and CP30 of the Core Strategy (2010)."
